12", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974895_2782921358407273_8286746867685916672_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qzQF75AjkzUQ7kNvwHbDiy2&_nc_oc=Adp_-MrpC77ZpOEhgx2t6VQTOVD1tQ2hcV3U6iMloH3N1s6LNY4-fZn-lGPNrYvMtw4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSaI_Zcn20AwOC24MuiQ3f63hFOIFpzLqql5gG6TIEUGw&oe=6B032F40"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "226382648486209", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974772_573180143444579_252541139247169536_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Xt63dgn_KdYQ7kNvwEdIjBC&_nc_oc=Ado0oxGfgEUiPo_ECFSJ0QpNGfD1fpR5J99Z-gFSsp_4R3Qyi9pHlZihSwZ4O1FSDgY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSyueRWW8xib9XUB4h1EddnX9_W-1RpfwLxMjzU5E-AUQ&oe=6B031D03"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "207400557024906", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031376_535896637206448_3584357517993443328_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=s72AbL7vxTkQ7kNvwGmyNiK&_nc_oc=AdpOFazhJTvZNeOTDdA0-lu4KNUuc3ATdJgHkADrRslR7z6v1ACbtphnEA5gmK5dghM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQT0UHsf_c61_Ggnw36G-27BhjS33XQd6OcZkvPuFvu4aw&oe=6B0308AB"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "/tmp/4SODRK", "id": "2585744548143713", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974801_2585744551477046_348014216378056704_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=XtcVB9VSctgQ7kNvwF77D19&_nc_oc=Adp3Xk-7d_aba4Izqu9p0wwEqyNba0TawIShjpzudEL1lYjLjdfBFHM9cEBxG_kn-M0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQR3Ap83Iz8CCtvLDz5yQXh8O59EG6PUh5R_x3eX4yYtGg&oe=6B030256"}, "display_name": "Bingo VR", "keywords": ["bingo", "casino", "entertainment", "poker", "casual"], "long_description": "Aliens. They showed up uninvited. They are taking over. They are everywhere. Earthlings are in trouble. They need to push back and take the fight back to them, to the alien home-world.\n\nA stealth super-weapon developed at Area 51 has been proven to deliver on the promise. What is that weapon?  BINGO!\n\nHow can BINGO! defeat aliens, you ask? It would be too complicated to explain here, but it is awe-inspiring. Aliens don't like losing, and especially when playing BINGO!\n\nEach BINGO! gets earthlings closer to the goal of defeating aliens. Each card is a ticket to success. Make your way to the alien council. Close it out.", "short_description": "It is unheard of that a casual BINGO! game is a weapon of choice which drives aliens to their homeworld and defeats them forevermore.\n\nYet, it is based on a true story."}]}, "developer_name": "Babaroga, LLC", "developer_privacy_policy_url": null, "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Babaroga, LLC", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://babaroga.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["SOCIAL", "CASUAL", "PUZZLE"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED_FOR_DOWNLOAD", "play_area": null, "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["GEAR_VR_CONTROLLER"], "supported_player_modes": [], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "655286585817079"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1320911764735868"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1320911764735868"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1575568839, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1320911764735868"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "2965733006792446", "version": "5.8.1586"}, "id": "523403618203341", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "2617214288310988", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "2965733006792446"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "523403618203341"}]}, "change_log": "Added polish. Pinch of Love.\nThe user's avatar changed. What an icon! Tuns out his lost long brother lived in a galaxy far far away, but they never met. His father said that he was going to the Spaceport Cantina for a drink and a pack of smokes. Then he lost his way. That was not a parent figure one would look for. Anyway, our hero is everyone's hero - a hero in all of us. Aliens now have an image of a rebel that they fear. And fear they should!\n", "created_date": 1581116964, "id": "2965733006792446", "version": "5.8.1586", "version_code": 1586, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "2617214288310988", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "2965733006792446"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "523403618203341"}]}, "change_log": "Hi! We did it again! We update the app you love so you can love it even more. \n\n\n\n\nWe added infinite boards purchase. This way you will never run out of boards again. Ever. That's super cool, right?\n\n\n\n\nWe also fixed some nagging bugs that hinder the full experience. There is no way you will not love this game. Unless you love aliens, and you want them to win...that's on you.", "created_date": 1580222244, "id": "2943990928966654", "version": "5.8.1573", "version_code": 1573, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "2617214288310988", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "2965733006792446"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": []}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1579900920, "id": "2936504706381943", "version": "5.8.1568", "version_code": 1568, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "2617214288310988", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "2965733006792446"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "523403618203341"}]}, "change_log": "Visual update to the 'ball throw-away' tutorial. - Did you know you can shoot away from the board to discard the ball? It goes away after the first BINGO!", "created_date": 1579806968, "id": "2934282629937484", "version": "5.8.1565", "version_code": 1565, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "2617214288310988", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "2965733006792446"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "523403618203341"}]}, "change_log": "- HUGE: Select 1,2,or 3 boards to play\n- did you know you can throw away balls by shooting outside of the board area?\n- tutorial pod telling you when to throw-away balls. It helps you through the first bingo!\n- added lots of love\n- removed bunch o' bugs", "created_date": 1579732724, "id": "2932552906777123", "version": "5.8.1560", "version_code": 1560, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}]}}, "viewer": {"user": null}}}